    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Fire Mastery.</strong> Spells you cast ignore Resistance to Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Ignite.</strong> When a spell you cast deals Fire damage to a creature, the target starts burning. When you deal Fire damage to a creature that is already burning, the flames grow fiercer, increasing the burning damage by 1d4.</p>",
